  "details": "Something is telling me this has a higher chance of being noticed if it's pitched specifically for VRC Plus. \n\nSince discord integration, I wouldn't see why it wouldn't be possible to potentially either give folks an option to use their display name versus having to change your account name. I think most of us are aware that there is some sort of feature like this already in play for Steam users since the dawn of time, You just received number-character string after whatever you changed your name to. \n\nI could totally see tons of people being on board with this. Having the ability to have a display name for only VRC plus subscribers to start. I'm sure the return on investment would pay itself off very quick eventually leading to a global allowance so non plus members would eventually have the ability.",
